    "物理公式：\n",
    "\n",
    "$V = V_{0} + at$\n",
    "\n",
    "$S = V_{0}t+ \\frac{1}{2} at^{2}$\n",
    "\n",
    "$S$ 改時間為 $2t$：\n",
    "\n",
    "$S = V_{0}2t+ \\frac{1}{2} a(2t)^{2} = 2t(V_{0} + at) = 2tV$ "
   ]
